---
layout: layouts/base.njk
isHome: true
title: 机场推荐、客户端教程与网络工具指南
description: 机场图提供机场推荐与选择指南、线路协议知识、客户端教程、故障排查、流媒体和 AI 工具内容，帮助中文用户做出更清晰的判断。
permalink: /index.html
---
{% from "macros/icon.njk" import icon %}
{% from "macros/cards.njk" import articleCard, faq %}

<section class="paper-texture relative overflow-hidden border-b border-line">
  <div class="absolute left-[-8rem] top-[-6rem] size-[30rem] rounded-full bg-[#fed7aa]/35 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute right-[-7rem] top-20 size-[28rem] rounded-full bg-[#d1fae5]/38 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="container-shell relative grid min-h-[680px] items-center gap-14 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_.92fr] lg:py-24">
    <div class="animate-reveal max-w-2xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white/85 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-700 shadow-card backdrop-blur"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-forest-600 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(4,120,87,.12)]"></span>机场选择 · 客户端教程 · 故障排查</div>
      <h1 class="mt-7 text-[clamp(2.75rem,5vw,4.65rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.05em] text-ink-950">让复杂的网络工具<br><span class="gradient-text">变得清楚、更可信</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-ink-500 sm:text-lg">从机场推荐、线路协议到客户端配置，用结构化文章和可复查的判断方法，帮助你少踩坑、少走弯路。</p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/airport/" class="focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-ink-950 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-brand-600">查看机场推荐 {{ icon('arrow', 17) }}</a><a href="/blog/airport-selection-guide/" class="focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-700 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-brand-100 hover:text-brand-700">{{ icon('book', 17) }}新手选择指南</a></div>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-xs text-ink-500">{% for item in ['推广关系明确标注','文章持续修订','移动端舒适阅读'] %}<span class="flex items-center gap-2">{{ icon('check', 15, 'text-forest-600') }}{{ item }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="animate-float relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[31rem] lg:ml-auto">
      <div class="absolute -inset-6 rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500/12 to-forest-600/12 blur-2xl"></div>
      <div class="surface-card relative overflow-hidden p-6 sm:p-7">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line pb-5"><div><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[.12em] text-brand-600">READING MAP</span><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-ink-950">从你的问题开始</h2></div><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#273c34] text-white">{{ icon('grid', 20) }}</span></div>
        {% set mapItems = [{icon:'shield',title:'第一次怎么选',text:'预算、线路与风险'},{icon:'monitor',title:'客户端怎么装',text:'按平台逐步配置'},{icon:'layers',title:'连接出现问题',text:'从订阅到 DNS 排查'},{icon:'compare',title:'方案有什么差别',text:'统一维度做比较'}] %}
        <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">{% for item in mapItems %}<div class="rounded-2xl border border-line p-4 {% if loop.first %}bg-brand-50{% else %}bg-[#faf8f3]{% endif %}">{{ icon(item.icon, 19, 'text-brand-600' if loop.first else 'text-forest-600') }}<h3 class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-950">{{ item.title }}</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[0.68rem] leading-5 text-ink-500">{{ item.text }}</p></div>{% endfor %}</div>
        <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-[#40534a] bg-[#273c34] p-5 text-white"><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs"><span class="text-[#c7d1cc]">建议阅读顺序</span><span class="font-semibold text-[#f4c57f]">选择 → 配置 → 验证</span></div><div class="mt-3 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10"><div class="h-full w-[92%] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500 to-[#34a37b]"></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-[#b8c6bf]">先小额验证自己的网络环境，再决定是否长期续费。</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-b border-line bg-[#faf8f3] py-7"><div class="container-shell grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-center sm:grid-cols-4">{% for stat in [{value:collections.posts.length,label:'已发布文章'},{value:'149',label:'去重主题词'},{value:'11',label:'搜索意图集群'},{value:'100%',label:'静态快速访问'}] %}<div><strong class="font-display block text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-950">{{ stat.value }}</strong><span class="mt-1 block text-[0.68rem] tracking-wide text-ink-500">{{ stat.label }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-[#efe7dc]"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Explore</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">按任务找到需要的内容</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] leading-7 text-ink-500">教程解决操作问题，评测与对比帮助做决定，专题和知识库负责把相关问题连接起来。</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">{% for feature in home.features %}<a href="{{ feature.url }}" class="focus-ring group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#ded5c8] bg-white/90 p-6 shadow-card transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-100 hover:shadow-soft"><span class="absolute right-5 top-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[#eee9e1]">0{{ loop.index }}</span><div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 transition group-hover:bg-brand-600 group-hover:text-white">{{ icon(feature.icon, 21) }}</div><h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-950">{{ feature.title }}</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-500">{{ feature.description }}</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-forest-600">进入栏目 {{ icon('arrow', 14) }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="overflow-hidden border-y border-line bg-[#e5ede7]"><div class="container-shell grid gap-0 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.02fr_.98fr] lg:items-center lg:py-20"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white/80 bg-[#f5f2eb] shadow-soft lg:rounded-r-none"><img src="/images/editorial-workspace.svg" alt="温润燕麦色书桌、电脑、台灯与绿植组成的编辑工作场景插画" width="1200" height="820" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-full min-h-[300px] w-full object-cover"></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] border border-[#40534a] bg-[#273c34] p-7 text-white shadow-soft lg:-ml-8 lg:p-11"><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.15em] text-[#f4c57f]">A CALMER WAY TO CHOOSE</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.035em] sm:text-4xl">把选择过程慢下来，答案反而更清晰</h2><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-[#c7d1cc]">先明确使用场景，再小额验证真实网络，最后决定是否长期续费。我们把复杂参数拆成可以逐项核对的步骤。</p><div class="mt-7 grid gap-3">{% for item in ['先按预算、设备和场景缩小范围','用月付方案验证晚高峰与常用节点','遇到问题按订阅、客户端、网络顺序排查'] %}<div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.045] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#e6ece8]">{{ icon('check', 17, 'mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#79c4a5]') }}<span>{{ item }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/blog/airport-selection-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-950">阅读选择指南 {{ icon('arrow', 15) }}</a><a href="/blog/airport-troubleshooting/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/20 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">查看排错清单</a></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section-space border-y border-line bg-paper"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 flex items-end justify-between gap-6"><div class="max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Featured Articles</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">从这些完整指南开始</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] leading-7 text-ink-500">内容覆盖选择、线路、客户端、场景、价格和故障排查，文章之间已经建立相关阅读入口。</p></div><a href="/blog/" class="hidden text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700 sm:block">查看全部文章 →</a></div><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">{% for post in collections.posts | limit(6) %}{{ articleCard(post, loop.index0) }}{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-[#faf8f3]"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Topic Clusters</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">沿着一条路径读懂一个主题</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink-500">不必在零散文章之间反复搜索。每个专题都从核心问题进入，再连接配置、比较和排错内容。</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{% for topic in home.topics %}<a href="{{ topic.url }}" class="focus-ring group flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-100 hover:shadow-soft"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl {{ topic.accent }}">{{ icon(topic.icon, 21) }}</span><span class="rounded-full bg-paper px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-500">{{ topic.count }} 篇指南</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-950">{{ topic.title }}</h3><p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-500">{{ topic.description }}</p><span class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-line pt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-forest-600">开始阅读 {{ icon('arrow-up-right', 17) }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="border-y border-[#40534a] bg-[#273c34] py-20 text-white lg:py-24"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="eyebrow !text-[#f4c57f]">Brand Library</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl">服务与客户端资料入口</h2><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-[#c7d1cc]">推广服务与知识条目分开标注。外部服务的套餐和规则需要在访问后再次核验。</p><a href="/brands/" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/8 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">浏览完整资料库 {{ icon('arrow', 16) }}</a></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">{% for brand in home.brands %}<a href="{{ brand.url }}" {% if brand.external %}target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"{% endif %} class="group flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#e4ddd2] bg-white p-4 text-ink-900 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-soft"><span class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#78350f] to-brand-500 text-sm font-black text-white">{{ brand.mark }}</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><strong class="truncate text-sm">{{ brand.name }}</strong><small class="rounded bg-paper px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] text-ink-500">{{ brand.label }}</small></span><span class="mt-1 block truncate text-xs text-ink-500">{{ brand.description }}</span></span>{{ icon('chevron', 16, 'shrink-0 text-ink-300') }}</a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-paper"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mb-10 max-w-2xl"><span class="eyebrow">Comparison</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">先理解线路，再比较服务</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink-500">同一个名称可能对应不同实现，表格只用于理解常见倾向，购买前仍需核验具体入口、落地、带宽与服务条款。</p></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white shadow-card"><div class="hidden overflow-x-auto md:block"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-left"><thead><tr class="bg-[#273c34] text-white"><th class="px-6 py-5">对比维度</th><th class="px-6 py-5">{{ home.comparisons[0].a }}</th><th class="px-6 py-5">{{ home.comparisons[0].b }}</th><th class="px-6 py-5">{{ home.comparisons[0].c }}</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in home.comparisons %}{% if not loop.first %}<tr class="border-t border-line {% if loop.index0 % 2 %}bg-[#faf8f3]{% endif %}"><th class="px-6 py-5 text-sm">{{ row.dimension }}</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-sm text-ink-500">{{ row.a }}</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-sm text-ink-500">{{ row.b }}</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-sm text-ink-500">{{ row.c }}</td></tr>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div><div class="divide-y divide-line md:hidden">{% for row in home.comparisons %}<div class="p-5"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-950">{{ row.dimension }}</h3><dl class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-xs text-ink-500"><div><dt class="font-semibold text-ink-700">直连</dt><dd>{{ row.a }}</dd></div><div><dt class="font-semibold text-ink-700">中转</dt><dd>{{ row.b }}</dd></div><div><dt class="font-semibold text-ink-700">IPLC / 专线</dt><dd>{{ row.c }}</dd></div></dl></div>{% endfor %}</div></div><a href="/blog/airport-line-types/" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700">阅读完整线路指南 {{ icon('arrow', 16) }}</a></div></section>

<section class="section-space bg-[#faf8f3]"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-20"><div><span class="eyebrow">Editorial Principles</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">更适合长期使用的选择方法</h2><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-500">本站不会用一次测速或一个总分替代你的真实需求。以下三个原则适用于大多数服务选择。</p></div><div class="grid gap-8 border-l border-line pl-7 sm:pl-10">{% for item in home.principles %}<article><span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-600">{{ item.n }} / 选择原则</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-ink-950">{{ item.title }}</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-500">{{ item.text }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>

<section class="section-space border-t border-line bg-paper"><div class="container-shell"><div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">常见问题</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink-500">先了解本站如何组织内容、标注推广关系和处理变化较快的信息。</p></div>{{ faq(home.faqs) }}</div></section>

<section class="bg-paper pb-20 lg:pb-28"><div class="container-shell"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-[#40534a] bg-[#273c34] px-6 py-14 text-white shadow-soft sm:px-10 lg:px-16"><div class="absolute -right-24 -top-32 size-96 rounded-full bg-brand-500/25 blur-3xl"></div><div class="relative grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center"><div><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.15em] text-[#f4c57f]">KEEP READING</span><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">从一个真实问题开始</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#c7d1cc]">查看完整文章，或通过 Telegram 提交勘误、收录建议与合作咨询。</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/blog/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-950">{{ icon('book', 17) }}浏览文章</a><a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">联系我们</a></div></div></div></div></section>
